    # 1. Cortical parcellation (D): Desikan-Killiany cortical parcellation (Desikan et al, 2006). Name: Desikan2006 (Desikan et al, 2006).
    # 2. Subcortical parcellation (F): Aseg subcortical parcellation. Name: Aseg (Fischl et al, 2002).
    # 3. Thalamic parcellation (M): Thalamic parcellation. Name: MIAL67ThalamicNuclei (Najdenovska and Aleman-Gomez et al, 2018).
    # 4. Amygdala parcellation (F): Amygdala segmentation. Name: Aseg (Fischl et al, 2002).
    # 5. Hippocampus parcellation (H): Head body and tail of the hippocampus. Name: HeadBodyTail (Iglesias et al, 2015).
    # 6. Hypothalamus parcellation (I): Hypothalamus parcellation. Name: FSHypoThalamicParc (Billot et al, 2020).
    # 7. Cerebellum parcellation (S): Cerebellum parcellation using the cerebellum atlas inlcluded in FSL (Diedrichsen, J. et al, 2009). Name: Diedrichsen2009 (Diedrichsen, J. et al, 2009).
    # 8. Brainstem parcellation (I): Brainstem parcellation. Name: FSBrainStemParc (Iglesias et al, 2015).
    # 9. GyralWM parcellation (F): Gyral white matter parcellation based on the projection of the cortical parcellation into the white matter. Name: Cortical (Depends on the cortical parcellation).
    # 10. The parcellation code N is not present in the dictionary for the supra-region WhiteMatter.

